d Zacatecas; and Ciudad Juárez and Reynosa cities. The company is also involved in leasing of space to restaurants and retailers. In addition, it engages in the operation of parking facilities; OMA Carga business comprising warehouses that provides cargo logistics services, such as storage, handling, custody maneuvers, loading and unloading, x-ray screening of exports, and other services; the Terminal 2 NH Collection Hotel; and the Hilton Garden Inn Hotel at the Monterrey airport; and non-permanent ground transportation. Further, the company provides aeronautical services, which include passenger, aircraft landing and parking, airport security, passenger walkway, and complementary services; car parking; checked baggage-screening services; and construction services. Additionally, it builds and operates industrial park at the Monterrey airport. Grupo Aeroportuario del Centro Norte, S.A.B. de C.V. was incorporated in 1998 and is based in Mexico City, Mexico.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"4581","sic_desc":"Airports, Flying Fields & Airport Terminal Services","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airports & Air Services","mcap":4546662400,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"APODACA, NY","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1378239,"state_inc":"O5","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":4353173000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":27.68,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":1335472000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":30.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":3929012000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":31.2,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":1504373000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":38.3,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-12-31","rev":4113416000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":25.2,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":1217201000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":2